Package: snp
Title: Plot standard normal distribution
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Dimitrios", "Zacharatos", , "dimitrios@psycholate.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1789-8294"))
Author: Dimitrios Zacharatos [aut, cre]
